{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112105","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112105/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112105/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112105/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112105","id":3558874234,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7UIBx6","number":112105,"title":"Wayland + libdecor 0.2.4: Extra empty spaces at top and bottom of window cause mouse event offset","user":{"login":"BrachystochroneSD","id":34922853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTIyODUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34922853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD","html_url":"https://github.com/BrachystochroneSD","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-10-27T22:28:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T08:35:51Z","closed_at":"2025-12-24T13:51:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5\n- Get a **segmentaion fault** with 4.4 and libdecor 0.2.4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable unknown - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 23 Oct 2025 18:49:03 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Vega 8 Graphics (RADV RAVEN) - AMD Ryzen 5 PRO 3500U w/ Radeon Vega Mobile Gfx (8 threads) - 13.53 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running Godot on Wayland with Wayland support enabled and using **libdecor 0.2.4**, all **non-fullscreen windows** (e.g. editor window, popups, etc.) have **two empty spaces**—one at the top and one at the bottom of the window.\n\nThese spaces are visually blank areas outside the main content, and they cause **mouse events to be vertically offset**, making clicking and interaction inaccurate.\n\nFullscreen windows are **not affected** and Downgrading to **libdecor 0.2.3** removes the issue.\n\nHere is a screenshot:\n\n<img width=\"1878\" height=\"1003\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a408bca7-7ba2-4af1-9ce7-1cc13c39bc28\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch Godot with Wayland support enabled.\n2. Use a system running **libdecor 0.2.4**.\n3. Open the editor or run a project in a non-fullscreen window.\n4. Observe empty margins at the top and bottom of the window.\n5. Try clicking inside the window — notice the **mouse offset**.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A (occurs with any project or in the editor itself).","closed_by":{"login":"BrachystochroneSD","id":34922853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTIyODUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34922853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD","html_url":"https://github.com/BrachystochroneSD","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrachystochroneSD/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.